  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What mirrors",
      "items": [
        "Every chat of an enabled bot from CLI, TUI, Desktop and Conduit appears in bb by itself and keeps updating. No \"Continue in bb\" step (D42).",
        "Each bot's Bot Chat goes to that bot's pinned bb thread, not a new one (D44)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "What stays out",
      "items": [
        "Cron and one-shot runs; chats of bots that are switched off.",
        "Discord, Telegram, Slack and other chat apps: proposed, pending Q23. A Discord DM is its own Hermes chat, not the Bot Chat."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Notifications and open items",
      "items": [
        "Outside activity marks the thread unread. Approvals and clarify questions send a push.",
        "Open, to be decided in the plan rewrite: how v1 reads saved chats; when the import runs for a bot switched on later; whether you confirm import counts first."
      ]
    }
  ]
